### 1. Health -> UP
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 2. Lena registriert sich -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lena@example.com", "password": "geheim123", "displayName": "Lena" }

### 3. Lena meldet sich an -> 200 mit Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lena@example.com", "password": "geheim123" }
> {% client.global.set("lenaToken", response.body.token); %}

### 4. Themen ansehen (öffentlich)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/topics

### 5. Quiz "Datenbanken" starten -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{lenaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "topicId": 2 }
> {% client.global.set("lenaAttemptId", response.body.attemptId);

### 6. Frage 4 (Freitext) -> richtig
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attempts/{{lenaAttemptId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{lenaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "questionId": 4, "freeText": "select" }

### 7. Frage 5 (Multiple Choice) -> teilweise richtig
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attempts/{{lenaAttemptId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{lenaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "questionId": 5, "selectedOptionIds": [30, 31, 32] }

### 8. Abschließen -> 15 von 30 Punkten (50 %), Frage 6 unbeantwortet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attempts/{{lenaAttemptId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{lenaToken}}

### 9. Meine Versuche zu Thema 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/topics/2/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{lenaToken}}

### 10. Lena darf keine Themen anlegen -> 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{lenaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Docker" }

### 11. Admin meldet sich mit dem Passwort aus .env an -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@quiz.local", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }
> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### 12. Admin legt ein Thema an -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Docker", "description": "Images, Container, Compose" }

### 13. Admin liest Lenas Versuch -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attempts/{{lenaAttemptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Lena meldet sich ab -> 204, danach /me -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{lenaToken}}
